# App Router

- Routes live under `app/[lang]/`. Keep `lang` typed as `Lang` from `content/i18n`.
- Server Components by default; add `'use client'` only for interaction (forms, scroller, nav menu).
- Colocate `page.module.css` with the route. Shared chrome: `Nav`, `Footer`, `Progress` from lang layout.
- Contact form uses Supabase via `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL` / `NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` — never hardcode keys.
- Matcher in middleware already skips `_next`, `api`, and static files with extensions.
